### Smart Load Registers (Completed)
**Date**: December 2024  
**Description**: Implemented comprehensive Smart Load functionality for EG4 18kPV inverters, including enable/disable control, voltage thresholds, SOC limits, and PV power controls.

**Features Added**:
- **7 New Registers**: Smart Load enable/disable control, Grid Always On enable/disable control, voltage thresholds, SOC limits, and PV power controls
- **Smart Load Enable/Disable Control**: Register 179, Bit 13 controls Smart Load functionality (0=disabled, 1=enabled)
- **Grid Always On Enable/Disable Control**: Register 137, Bit 0 controls Grid Always On functionality (0=enabled, 1=disabled)
- **Smart Load Voltage Thresholds**: Start and end voltage limits for Smart Load operation (40.0V-60.0V in 0.1V units)
- **Smart Load SOC Thresholds**: Start and end SOC limits for Smart Load operation (0-100%)
- **Start PV Power Control**: PV power threshold for Smart Load activation (0.0-10.0kW in 0.1kW units)
- **Full MQTT Integration**: Command parsing and topic routing for all Smart Load functions
- **Home Assistant Discovery**: Automatic entity creation with proper categorization

**Technical Details**:
- **Register 179, Bit 13**: Smart Load Enable/Disable control (0=disabled, 1=enabled)
- **Register 137, Bit 0**: Grid Always On Enable/Disable control (0=enabled, 1=disabled) - **Note**: Uses inverted logic
- **Register 213**: Smart Load Start Voltage (0.1V units, 40.0V-60.0V)
- **Register 214**: Smart Load End Voltage (0.1V units, 40.0V-60.0V)
- **Register 215**: Smart Load Start SOC (0-100%)
- **Register 216**: Smart Load End SOC (0-100%)
- **Register 217**: Start PV Power (0.1kW units, 0.0-10.0kW)
- **Value Templates**: Proper unit conversions for Home Assistant display
- **MQTT Topics**: Named command topics for proper routing (e.g., `smart_load_enable`, `grid_always_on`, `smart_load_start_volt`)

